<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 405)</h2>
<p><b>License in the box, and a proper front door on the web.</b></p>
<ul>
<li>Help → License &amp; Disclaimer: the terms ship in the manual (© 2026 Autonomy, LLC), and the web page carries the same at review.byautonomy.com/eula.</li>
<li>Visiting the web review page without a link now shows a branded Asobi × AUTONOMY landing instead of an empty player; the app download offer only appears for seats that arrived with a session key.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
